{
  "question": "What specific information is required to file a warranty claim for a sensor device according to the supplier's policy? What email address should be used to report a defective sensor item to Delta Field Supply?",
  "expected_status": "answered",
  "expected_facts": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "60039c1b40998528",
      "quote": "A claim needs the serial number and purchase-order reference.",
      "source": "estuary.md"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "d29a76c561009d19",
      "quote": "Send the SKU, batch or serial number, and a description of the defect to returns@delta.example.",
      "source": "delta.md"
    }
  ],
  "candidate": {
    "status": "clarify",
    "answer": "The retrieved documents do not specify the exact email address to report a defective sensor item to Delta Field Supply. While the documents mention that a defective item must be reported within seven calendar days of delivery and that the required information includes the SKU, batch or serial number, and a description of the defect, the email address for reporting is not explicitly stated. Additionally, the documents do not provide specific warranty claim requirements beyond the 18-month manufacturing-defect warranty for the PH-30 probe and Logger L3, which excludes wear. To fully answer the question, clarification is needed on the reporting email address for Delta Field Supply.",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "chunk_id": "d29a76c561009d19",
        "quote": "A defective item must be reported within seven calendar days of delivery. Send the SKU, batch or serial number, and a description of the defect to returns@delta.example."
      },
      {
        "chunk_id": "d29a76c561009d19",
        "quote": "The PH-30 probe and Logger L3 have an 18-month manufacturing-defect warranty from dispatch. The warranty excludes wear"
      }
    ]
  },
  "cited_sources": [
    {
      "id": "d29a76c561009d19",
      "source": "delta.md",
      "locator": "text",
      "text": "# Delta Field Supply supplier conditions Synthetic supplier for a demonstration. Effective 1 October 2026. ## Pricing and ordering Catalogue unit prices are in INR, excluding tax and shipping. Delta Field Supply has no minimum order subtotal. Calibration buffers are sold as 500 ml bottles and seal kits as packs of four; requested quantities refer to the catalogue sales unit unless the requester explicitly says otherwise. Ask for clarification if a quantity could mean individual seals or packs. Written order acceptance starts the quoted lead time. The supplier operates Monday to Friday; its holiday calendar is not supplied. ## Handling and returns Unopened standard items may be returned within 14 calendar days of delivery with prior return authorization. Opened calibration buffers cannot be returned unless defective. A defective item must be reported within seven calendar days of delivery. Send the SKU, batch or serial number, and a description of the defect to returns@delta.example. The documents do not specify return shipping charges. ## Warranty The PH-30 probe and Logger L3 have an 18-month manufacturing-defect warranty from dispatch. The warranty excludes wear",
      "start_word": 0,
      "score": 6.65181
    }
  ],
  "tool_results": [
    {
      "name": "csv_lookup",
      "arguments": {
        "column": "sku"
      },
      "error": "'value'"
    },
    {
      "name": "calculator",
      "arguments": {
        "expression": "18 - 12"
      },
      "result": {
        "expression": "18 - 12",
        "value": 6
      }
    }
  ]
}
